         Core/Defs/RecipeDefs/Recipes_Production.xml:356 Make_ComponentIndustrial（RecipeDef 范本：
             workSpeedStat/workSkill/effectWorking/soundWorking/workAmount/unfinishedThingDef/ingredients/
             fixedIngredientFilter/skillRequirements/displayPriority）
         Core/Defs/RecipeDefs/Recipes_Meals.xml:32 CookMealSimple（ingredients/li/filter/categories/li 的真实用法，第 43-52 行）
         Core/Defs/RecipeDefs/Recipes_Meals.xml:53 products 写法：<产物 defName>数量</产物 defName>
         Core/Defs/RecipeDefs/Recipes_Production.xml:13 MakeStoneBlocksBase（recipeUsers 真实用法）
       1.6 -> 1.7 冲突点：1.6 模板把产物写成 <products><li><thingDef>..</thingDef><count>..</count></li></products>，
       1.7 字段表里 products 下没有 thingDef/count 子路径，正确写法是「子元素名 = 产物 defName，值 = 数量」。
       productHasIngredientStuff：等离子匕首是「材料决定」的物品（costStuffCount），手写配方必须显式声明
       productHasIngredientStuff=true，产物才会继承输入材料（否则用默认材料）。
       该字段在 1.7 DLL 的元数据名表里存在（Assembly-CSharp.dll UTF-8 字符串堆偏移 12707852），
       但原版 XML 0 处使用 —— 因为原版这类配方都由 RecipeDefGenerator 依 recipeMaker 在代码里生成。
       配方入口：RecipeDef/recipeUsers = DM_Building_TestBench 与建筑上的 <recipes> 列表互为补充，
       ThingDef.AllRecipes 用 List.Contains 去重，所以不会出现重复账单（两条都写是双保险）。
       本文件两条配方都不写 researchPrerequisite，保证一开局就能在测试台上造出来。 -->

  <RecipeDef>
    <defName>DM_Recipe_PlasmaDagger</defName>
    <label>make plasma dagger (test)</label>
    <description>Assemble a test-mod plasma dagger from metallic stuff.</description>
    <jobString>Making a plasma dagger.</jobString>
    <workSpeedStat>GeneralLaborSpeed</workSpeedStat>
    <workSkill>Crafting</workSkill>
    <effectWorking>Smith</effectWorking>
    <soundWorking>Recipe_Smith</soundWorking>
    <workAmount>3000</workAmount>
    <unfinishedThingDef>UnfinishedWeapon</unfinishedThingDef>
    <ingredients>
      <li>
        <filter>
          <categories>
            <li>Metallic</li>
          </categories>
        </filter>
        <count>50</count>
      </li>
    </ingredients>
    <fixedIngredientFilter>
      <categories>
        <li>Metallic</li>
      </categories>
      <disallowedThingDefs>
        <li>Silver</li>
        <li>Gold</li>
      </disallowedThingDefs>
    </fixedIngredientFilter>
    <productHasIngredientStuff>true</productHasIngredientStuff>
    <products>
      <DM_Weapon_PlasmaDagger>1</DM_Weapon_PlasmaDagger>
    </products>
    <skillRequirements>
      <Crafting>3</Crafting>
    </skillRequirements>
    <recipeUsers>
      <li>DM_Building_TestBench</li>
    </recipeUsers>
    <displayPriority>410</displayPriority>
  </RecipeDef>

